# 🌐 Personal Developer Portfolio

A sleek, responsive, modern personal developer portfolio featuring a dark glassmorphism theme, ambient lighting effects, and fluid CSS animations. Deployed live using **GitHub Pages**.

🔗 **Live Demo:** [https://navidanihara-sketch.github.io/my-portfolio/](https://navidanihara-sketch.github.io/my-portfolio/)

---

## 🚀 Built With

- **HTML5:** Semantic, clean structure.
- **Tailwind CSS:** Modern utility-first styling and glassmorphism UI.
- **Lucide Icons:** Clean, lightweight vector iconography.
- **GitHub Pages:** Automated deployment and hosting.

---

## ✨ Features

- **Glassmorphism Aesthetic:** Translucent cards with blurred backdrops and neon accents.
- **Ambient Glow Animations:** Custom CSS keyframes creating smooth background floating orbs.
- **Multi-page Architecture:** Dedicated views for About Me, Technical Skills, and Projects.
- **Fully Responsive:** Optimized across mobile, tablet, and widescreen desktop layouts.

